       "acrm---key-feature-5-content": "<h3>An alert when a count crosses your line</h3><p>Set a line, such as half the buyers of one style saying it runs small. The merchandiser gets a Slack or email alert once it is crossed, naming the style and the count.</p>",
       "alpb---prompt": "<p>Build clothes survey questions for my denim brand that ask each buyer how the jean fits in the waist, hip, and length.</p><div data-rt-embed-type='true'><div data-rt-embed-type='true'><script> window.awbPrompt = {\"default\": \"Build clothes survey questions for my denim brand that ask each buyer how the jean fits in the waist, hip, and length.\", \"chips\": [{\"label\": \"Fit Feedback\", \"add\": \"Add fit questions that flag any style where more than half the buyers say it runs small.\"}, {\"label\": \"Color Vote\", \"add\": \"Add a vote on 4 colors for the next production run, with a count per color.\"}, {\"label\": \"School Uniform\", \"add\": \"Add a uniform vote with one answer per family, checked against the school roster.\"}, {\"label\": \"Fashion Research\", \"add\": \"Add questions on secondhand buying, with a chart of the reasons people give.\"}]}; </script></div></div>",
       "acrm---key-feature-2-image": {
        "fileId": "6afac85048e3fac96cc9b1ac",
        "url": "https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a0f028de6df6a6fd88c3f89/6afac85048e3fac96cc9b1ac_uc-2.svg",
        "alt": "A phone vote on the fall sweater color shows rust leading with 88 of 205 votes, ahead of oat at 51, and rust gets the larger mill order."
       }
      }
     },
